cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite the work below."
title: "Byte-Level Machine Translation for Old Assyrian Akkadian"
abstract: >-
  A study of how model capacity interacts with domain-specific preprocessing in
  low-resource ancient-language machine translation, using Akkadian-to-English
  translation as a testbed. Finds that byte-level tokenisation dominates model
  capacity, and that preprocessing interventions help smaller models but are
  absorbed by larger ones.
type: software
